---
import GlowIcon from "./GlowIcon.astro";
---

<section class="focus section-shell" id="focus" data-section="focus" data-node-id="358:519">
  <div data-reveal="icon">
    <GlowIcon variant="focus" nodeId="358:520" />
  </div>

  <div class="section-copy focus__copy" data-node-id="358:533">
    <div class="display-heading-mask" data-reveal="heading">
      <h2 class="sr-only">Focus</h2>
      <picture>
        <source media="(max-width: 640px)" srcset="/assets/heading-focus-mobile.png" />
        <img class="display-heading display-heading--focus" src="/assets/heading-focus.png" alt="" width="364" height="42" data-node-id="358:534" />
      </picture>
    </div>

    <p class="section-headline focus__headline localized-copy" data-reveal="copy" data-node-id="358:535">
      <span data-locale="ru">Сделал дизайн-систему и внедрил AI <br />для брендирования white-label продукта</span>
      <span data-locale="en" hidden>Built a design system and introduced AI <br />for white-label product branding</span>
    </p>

    <div class="focus__body" data-reveal="copy" data-node-id="358:536">
      <div data-locale="ru">
        <p>Около 20 лет занимаюсь дизайном.<br class="focus__mobile-break" /> За это время сменил 6 компаний.</p>
        <p>С марта 2022 работаю в Premium Exchanger на позиции Senior Product Designer.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-locale="en" hidden>
        <p>I have worked in design for almost 20 years across six companies.</p>
        <p>Since March 2022, I have been a Senior Product Designer at Premium Exchanger.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
